WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:25.233
[Gentle Piano Intro]

00:00:25.233 --> 00:00:29.015
She breaks the quiet, asks my name

00:00:31.536 --> 00:00:35.500
A nervous laugh, a world of shame

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.500
"It's Aubrey, just the same as you"

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.380
"But spelled a different way, it's true"

00:00:46.302 --> 00:00:49.263
She doesn't flinch, she doesn't run

00:00:52.361 --> 00:00:55.404
This simple kindness has begun...

00:00:57.946 --> 00:01:01.500
I have to tell her, have to say

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:05.112
The reason I was named this way

00:01:06.694 --> 00:01:10.000
"My mother's name is Aubrie, too"

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.580
"It's something that she thought to do..."

00:01:16.332 --> 00:01:19.833
It was a joke that just kind of stuck

00:01:19.853 --> 00:01:23.000
A name I've cursed, my rotten luck

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.200
A label that she put on me

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:29.934
That I was never meant to be

00:01:29.974 --> 00:01:34.000
But looking at her, I can see

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.496
A chance to change my history

00:01:40.556 --> 00:01:45.500
This is my chance, this is the day

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:50.000
I'll be the one to walk away

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:54.500
From "Aubrey" and the life he led

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:58.500
The name she used inside my head

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:03.000
This is my first act of defiance

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:08.088
My declaration of alliance...

00:02:10.555 --> 00:02:13.800
It was a joke that just kind of stuck

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:17.000
But now I'm making my own luck

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:20.000
I'm shedding skin I've worn too long

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:23.746
A place where I could not belong

00:02:23.806 --> 00:02:26.668
You can call me Jordan

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:34.575
Yeah, you can call me Jordan, from now on...

00:02:38.849 --> 00:02:41.571
Call me Jordan.

00:02:44.873 --> 00:03:03.880
Call me Jordan...
